--- THG-12: an undefaulted field of each zero-having type ---
A thing called sounding has
    a time called 'the chain length',
    a number called 'the spread',
    a float called 'the depth in fathoms',
    a boolean called 'the freeboard'.

a sounding called i1.
If i1's 'the spread' is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0 got {i1's 'the spread'}", Exit 95. Print i1's 'the spread'.
If i1's 'the depth in fathoms' is not 0.0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0.0 got {i1's 'the depth in fathoms'}", Exit 95. Print i1's 'the depth in fathoms'.
If i1's 'the freeboard' then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0 got {i1's 'the freeboard'}", Exit 95. Print i1's 'the freeboard'.
If i1's 'the chain length' is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0 got {i1's 'the chain length'}", Exit 95. Print i1's 'the chain length'.

--- THG-12 again, a different order and kinds ---
A thing called sounding has
    a boolean called 'the paces walked',
    a number called 'the gradient',
    a time called 'the spread',
    a float called drift.

a sounding called i2.
If i2's 'the gradient' is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0 got {i2's 'the gradient'}", Exit 95. Print i2's 'the gradient'.
If i2's drift is not 0.0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0.0 got {i2's drift}", Exit 95. Print i2's drift.
If i2's 'the paces walked' then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0 got {i2's 'the paces walked'}", Exit 95. Print i2's 'the paces walked'.
If i2's 'the spread' is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0 got {i2's 'the spread'}", Exit 95. Print i2's 'the spread'.

--- THG-37: a defaulted float, a defaulted boolean, an undefaulted number ---
A thing called 'the datum point' has
    a boolean called 'the delta' is true,
    a number called drift,
    a float called 'the drop' is 3294500.77307058.

a 'the datum point' called i3.
If i3's 'the drop' is not 3294500.77307058 then, Print "ASSERT THG-37: expected 3294500.77307058 got {i3's 'the drop'}", Exit 95. Print i3's 'the drop'.
If i3's 'the delta' is false then, Print "ASSERT THG-37: expected 1 got {i3's 'the delta'}", Exit 95. Print i3's 'the delta'.
If i3's drift is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-37: expected 0 got {i3's drift}", Exit 95. Print i3's drift.

--- THG-25, THG-34: bare declaration, random field defaults ---
A thing called 'the station' has
    a number called 'the bearing in degrees' is 009421.

a 'the station' called i4.
Set a 'the station' called i5 to i4.
If i5's 'the bearing in degrees' is not 009421 then, Print "ASSERT THG-25: expected 009421 got {i5's 'the bearing in degrees'}", Exit 95. Print i5's 'the bearing in degrees'.

--- THG-25, THG-34 again, a different form and field shape ---
A thing called 'the trig point' has
    a number called 'the north offset' is -009448,
    a float called offset is 8681.35200259167915231475,
    a number called fall is 03954.

a 'the trig point' called i6.
If i6's 'the north offset' is not -009448 then, Print "ASSERT THG-25: expected -009448 got {i6's 'the north offset'}", Exit 95. Print i6's 'the north offset'.
If i6's offset is not 8681.35200259167915231475 then, Print "ASSERT THG-25: expected 8681.35200259167915231475 got {i6's offset}", Exit 95. Print i6's offset.
If i6's fall is not 03954 then, Print "ASSERT THG-25: expected 03954 got {i6's fall}", Exit 95. Print i6's fall.

--- THG-58: a function receives a copy, the caller is unchanged ---
A thing called 'the boundary stone' has
    a number called height is 875.

To 'the opening gambit' with a 'the boundary stone' called 'the brief trimming'.
    Set 'the brief trimming's height to 'the brief trimming's height add 15.
    Return a 'the boundary stone', 'the brief trimming'.

a 'the boundary stone' called i7.
a 'the boundary stone' called i8 is 'the opening gambit' to i7.
If i7's height is not 875 then, Print "ASSERT THG-58: expected 875 got {i7's height}", Exit 95. Print i7's height.
If i8's height is not 890 then, Print "ASSERT THG-58: expected 890 got {i8's height}", Exit 95. Print i8's height.

--- THG-64: a nested thing passed through a chained possessive is copied too ---
A thing called cairn has
    a number called span is -721.

A thing called 'the measurement' has
    a cairn called 'the gradient'.

To 'the opening gambit' of a cairn called dose.
    Set dose's span to dose's span add 30.
    Return a cairn, dose.

a 'the measurement' called i9.
a cairn called i10 is 'the opening gambit' of i9's 'the gradient'.
If i9's 'the gradient's span is not -721 then, Print "ASSERT THG-64: expected -721 got {i9's 'the gradient's span}", Exit 95. Print i9's 'the gradient's span.
If i10's span is not -691 then, Print "ASSERT THG-64: expected -691 got {i10's span}", Exit 95. Print i10's span.

--- names: no repeat across five type-spending leaves in one run ---
A thing called 'the field note' has
    a time called span,
    a boolean called 'the lie',
    a float called width,
    a number called 'the aspect'.

a 'the field note' called i11.
If i11's 'the aspect' is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0 got {i11's 'the aspect'}", Exit 95. Print i11's 'the aspect'.
If i11's width is not 0.0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0.0 got {i11's width}", Exit 95. Print i11's width.
If i11's 'the lie' then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0 got {i11's 'the lie'}", Exit 95. Print i11's 'the lie'.
If i11's span is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-12: expected 0 got {i11's span}", Exit 95. Print i11's span.
A thing called 'the survey marker' has
    a float called 'the bearing in degrees' is 4391.361956254287303,
    a boolean called 'the spread' is false,
    a number called offset.

a 'the survey marker' called i12.
If i12's 'the bearing in degrees' is not 4391.361956254287303 then, Print "ASSERT THG-37: expected 4391.361956254287303 got {i12's 'the bearing in degrees'}", Exit 95. Print i12's 'the bearing in degrees'.
If i12's 'the spread' then, Print "ASSERT THG-37: expected 0 got {i12's 'the spread'}", Exit 95. Print i12's 'the spread'.
If i12's offset is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT THG-37: expected 0 got {i12's offset}", Exit 95. Print i12's offset.
A thing called sounding has
    a number called 'the gradient' is 00904710,
    a float called depth is 598514038280.9111312342,
    a number called 'the run' is 0009121421454161.

a sounding called i13.
Set a sounding called i14 to i13.
If i14's 'the gradient' is not 00904710 then, Print "ASSERT THG-25: expected 00904710 got {i14's 'the gradient'}", Exit 95. Print i14's 'the gradient'.
If i14's depth is not 598514038280.9111312342 then, Print "ASSERT THG-25: expected 598514038280.9111312342 got {i14's depth}", Exit 95. Print i14's depth.
If i14's 'the run' is not 0009121421454161 then, Print "ASSERT THG-25: expected 0009121421454161 got {i14's 'the run'}", Exit 95. Print i14's 'the run'.
A thing called 'the sighting' has
    a number called 'the freeboard' is 901.

To 'the opening gambit' with a 'the sighting' called 'the opening heap'.
    Set 'the opening heap's 'the freeboard' to 'the opening heap's 'the freeboard' add 6.
    Return a 'the sighting', 'the opening heap'.

a 'the sighting' called i15.
a 'the sighting' called i16 is 'the opening gambit' on i15.
If i15's 'the freeboard' is not 901 then, Print "ASSERT THG-58: expected 901 got {i15's 'the freeboard'}", Exit 95. Print i15's 'the freeboard'.
If i16's 'the freeboard' is not 907 then, Print "ASSERT THG-58: expected 907 got {i16's 'the freeboard'}", Exit 95. Print i16's 'the freeboard'.
A thing called coordinate has
    a number called 'the tide height' is 336.

A thing called 'the datum point' has
    a coordinate called 'the datum'.

To 'the gross weight' of a coordinate called 'the near sliver'.
    Set 'the near sliver's 'the tide height' to 'the near sliver's 'the tide height' add 5.
    Return a coordinate, 'the near sliver'.

a 'the datum point' called i17.
a coordinate called i18 is 'the gross weight' of i17's 'the datum'.
If i17's 'the datum's 'the tide height' is not 336 then, Print "ASSERT THG-64: expected 336 got {i17's 'the datum's 'the tide height'}", Exit 95. Print i17's 'the datum's 'the tide height'.
If i18's 'the tide height' is not 341 then, Print "ASSERT THG-64: expected 341 got {i18's 'the tide height'}", Exit 95. Print i18's 'the tide height'.

